usage: agm [-h] command ...

memSharing CLI(合同: docs/plan/architecture.md v2)

positional arguments:
  command
    enable-memory       经授权装配规则基座与可选记忆档
    enable-memory-batch
                        扫描 Git 主 checkout，集中批准后批量启用记忆
    remove-memory       仅撤销本工具所有权对象
    check-memory        只读报告现场状态与缺口

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
